Please send patches inline, each as a separate mail, instead of using
attachments.
This greatly simplifies review and integration of your patches.

It is easiest to send your patches directly from a version control
system like git, see
http://buildroot.uclibc.org/downloads/manual/manual.html#submitting-patches
because copy/pasting patches in a mail client typically does not work
correctly (whitespace/indentation issues).

>
